#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1234 expect=violation domain=DI
#note "Two devices (DEV1, DEV3) lack a DEVTYPE record. Sensitivity is Group over SPDEVID, so each device must yield its own finding -> exactly two violations."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt SPDEVID=DEV1
#expectViolationAt SPDEVID=DEV3
dataset DI label="Device Identifiers"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col SPDEVID  type=Char label="Sponsor Device Identifier"
col DISEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DIPARMCD type=Char label="Device Parameter Short Name"
col DIPARM   type=Char label="Device Parameter"
col DIVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | DI | DEV1 | 1 | MODEL   | Model Number | M-100
S1 | DI | DEV2 | 1 | DEVTYPE | Device Type  | CATHETER
S1 | DI | DEV3 | 1 | MANUF   | Manufacturer | ACME
